  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Perdón por pedírtelo así, ¿pero me puedes\nayudar a buscar a alguien?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006400F3006E00200070006F0072002000700065006400ED007200740065006C006F00200061007300ED002C002000BF007000650072006F0020006D00650020007000750065006400650073000A0061007900750064006100720020006100200062007500730063006100720020006100200061006C0067007500690065006E003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy buscando a una Domadragón que tiene\nun Dragalge como compañero.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F0079002000620075007300630061006E0064006F0020006100200075006E006100200044006F006D0061006400720061006700F3006E00200071007500650020007400690065006E0065000A0075006E002000440072006100670061006C0067006500200063006F006D006F00200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es alta y tiene el pelo verde.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007300200061006C00740061002000790020007400690065006E006500200065006C002000700065006C006F002000760065007200640065002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "También tiene un aspecto un poco... rudo,\ncomo que la ves y piensas: \"Uy, se ve que<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nesta es luchadora callejera o algo así\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si se te ocurre alguien que encaje con esta\ndescripción, dímelo, ¡por favor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te lo repito: busco a una Domadragón que tiene\nun Dragalge como compañero.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEs alta, tiene el pelo verde y parece luchadora\ncallejera.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué pasa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200070006100730061003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah, bueno! ¿Y ese look?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410068002C0020006200750065006E006F0021002000BF005900200065007300650020006C006F006F006B003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oye! Yo me visto como se me da la gana. Qué es\neso de andar criticando cómo se viste la gente...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En fin... Hacía mucho que no te veía, Marcia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000660069006E002E002E002E002000480061006300ED00610020006D007500630068006F00200071007500650020006E006F00200074006500200076006500ED0061002C0020004D00610072006300690061002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te aviso que he estado entrenando muy duro\nsolo para poder derrotarte.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Entrenar es natural para cualquier luchador!\nYo también soy más fuerte que antes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te ganaré y haré que cumplas la promesa que\nme hiciste!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065002000670061006E0061007200E900200079002000680061007200E90020007100750065002000630075006D0070006C006100730020006C0061002000700072006F006D0065007300610020007100750065000A006D006500200068006900630069007300740065002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Delphi! ¿Ya te estás divirtiendo sin mí?\n¿Por qué no me invitaste?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100440065006C0070006800690021002000BF00590061002000740065002000650073007400E10073002000640069007600690072007400690065006E0064006F002000730069006E0020006D00ED003F000A00BF0050006F007200200071007500E90020006E006F0020006D006500200069006E0076006900740061007300740065003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Arg...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100720067002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oye, tú, no te entrometas en nuestro combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F00790065002C0020007400FA002C0020006E006F00200074006500200065006E00740072006F006D006500740061007300200065006E0020006E00750065007300740072006F00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos a dejar bien clara una cosita: si quieres\ntener un combate contra Delphi, primero me<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntienes que pedir permiso a mí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Solo aceptaré si es un Combate Doble y tú peleas\njunto a <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006F006C006F0020006100630065007000740061007200E900200073006900200065007300200075006E00200043006F006D006200610074006500200044006F0062006C0065002000790020007400FA002000700065006C006500610073000A006A0075006E0074006F0020006100200010000201000000002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Todos miran y admiran a la estrella que los guía!\n¡Adelante, Clefable!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es hora de sacar a mi as bajo la manga.\n¡Megaevoluciona y dales su merecido, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya veo que no era mentira eso de que habías\nentrenado duro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590061002000760065006F00200071007500650020006E006F00200065007200610020006D0065006E0074006900720061002000650073006F0020006400650020007100750065002000680061006200ED00610073000A0065006E007400720065006E00610064006F0020006400750072006F002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro que no! Aunque admito que también le\ndebo la victoria a <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00200071007500650020006E006F0021002000410075006E007100750065002000610064006D00690074006F0020007100750065002000740061006D0062006900E9006E0020006C0065000A006400650062006F0020006C006100200076006900630074006F0072006900610020006100200010000201000000002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero sigue siendo una victoria. Y ahora tienes\nque cumplir tu promesa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Delphi, ¡forma una pareja de combate conmigo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065006C007000680069002C002000A10066006F0072006D006100200075006E006100200070006100720065006A006100200064006500200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E006D00690067006F002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esteee, cómo te lo digo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006500650065002C0020006300F3006D006F0020007400650020006C006F0020006400690067006F002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya tengo una pareja de combate. Lamento mucho\nno poder cumplir mi promesa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hiciste dúo con Inma, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480069006300690073007400650020006400FA006F00200063006F006E00200049006E006D0061002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, por insistencia de la señorita Anya.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C00200070006F007200200069006E00730069007300740065006E0063006900610020006400650020006C006100200073006500F1006F007200690074006100200041006E00790061002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya veo... Le dediqué demasiado tiempo\nal entrenamiento y al final llegué tarde.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no hay problema. Ah, y Delphi... \nEse uniforme te queda bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006E006F0020006800610079002000700072006F0062006C0065006D0061002E002000410068002C00200079002000440065006C007000680069002E002E002E0020000A00450073006500200075006E00690066006F0072006D00650020007400650020007100750065006400610020006200690065006E002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias a ti también, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004700720061006300690061007300200061002000740069002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002C00200010000201000000002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay... ¿Encontraré algún día una pareja de\ncombate ideal?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002E002E002E002000BF0045006E0063006F006E007400720061007200E900200061006C006700FA006E0020006400ED006100200075006E006100200070006100720065006A0061002000640065000A0063006F006D006200610074006500200069006400650061006C003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero encontrar una pareja de combate en la\nque pueda confiar ciegamente. ¡Alguien que se<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nentregue tanto como yo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    }
